+#### [Pass 2] The new ST-framed warning is also player-visible without the badge's legality explanation
+
+- **Severity:** Medium
+- **File:line:** `public/js/suite/sheet.js:739`; `public/js/editor/sheet.js:2231-2249,2380-2383`
